%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H12_X1_1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Actually, there's something I'm really craving right now. I hope it isn't
      too impolite to ask for food first thing after being welcomed into the home
      of the royal family.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Not really, I'm just a bit hungry\u2026 I don't suppose you have any bananas."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They both look at me with a bit of confusion.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We do. I can certainly bring you one if you would like.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She excuses herself and shortly returns with a banana.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse whispers to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Are you sure you are alright?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah, I think so.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take a bite and my eyes widen.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Mmmh\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This is the best thing I have ever eaten in my entire life.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The whole thing is devoured in no time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I will go and get some more for you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The two of them are clearly a bit concerned for me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: '{playerName}, what is that on your neck?'
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What do you mean?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to feel what he means by rubbing my neck with my hand. Then, I feel
      something just above my collarbone.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh, yeah, what is that?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There's a small patch of brown fur just peeking out from under my collar.
      I retract my hand in shock.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What in the world is this? Am I turning into an animal too now?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mom, come look at this, that is not a normal thing for humans.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She walks in with a whole bunch of bananas in her hands. When she spots
      my furry neck, she remains calm.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You need to ask Aphilia about this when you visit her. Until then, let
      us hope you remain in a stable physical state.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't know what all this monkey business is about, but I trust her and
      Mr. Horse.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c017f2dc9f1c531439bd28453439c861, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e153b3db0ceb4a37b024d1ab9e1b1851, type: 2}
